      "message": "In AV1, the maximum value of `width` and `height` is 2^16 \u003d 65536.\n\nAnd the maximum value of `area` is 2^16 * 2^16 \u003d 2^32, which is greater than both `INT_MAX` and `UINT_MAX`.",
      "revId": "88a775af3a0a1cb7b82db1c1f64f56712b565566",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
