      "writtenOn": "2025-05-21T16:25:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suppose `width` and `height` are both the AV1 maximum of 2^16. Is it possible for count_palette (an `int`) to overflow?\n\nI think it can\u0027t, because `count_palette` can be increment at most `(2^16 / kBlockHeight) * (2^16 / kBlockWidth)` times, which is \u003c `INT_MAX`.\n\nSimilarly I think `count_photo` and `count_intrabc` (also `int`) cannot possibly overflow.\n\nPlease double check my analysis.",
      "revId": "88a775af3a0a1cb7b82db1c1f64f56712b565566",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
    {
